                                        "entry_id": "6b651217-52e0-34a0-af8b-c4cc60b90498",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A booth erected to provide rudimentary shelter to a sentry on his/her post."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a5c34c4-6aad-4d5d-9357-3cc209d6c5da",
                                                "sense_id": "c9a238ee-3265-3b36-8445-94d1e8051b1e",
                                                "text": "As for chronology, I own, Trim, continued my uncle Toby, sitting down again coolly in his sentry-box, that, of all others, it seems a science which the soldiers might best spare, was it not for the lights which that science must one day give him, in determining the invention of powder; […]"
                                            }
